    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-456349"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:bf8a4fd7-a087-41f4-935b-f55b3414a97a"
                id="word_commented_712020:bf8a4fd7-a087-41f4-935b-f55b3414a97a"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Abf8a4fd7-a087-41f4-935b-f55b3414a97a">
                    梁家源
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">28/七月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-456349"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/364778" alt="image-20250728-072705.png" height="319" width="970" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>systemd 从V243版本开始默认支持cgroup v2。但也提供了编译参数，让发行厂商自行决定默认使用v1还是v2。 openeuler 2403sp1 的systemd版本应该就是用-Ddefault-hierarchy=legacy参数编译出来的。通过systemctl --version可以看到有{{default-hierarchy=legacy}}参数</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>[root@node-1 linux_old1]# systemctl --version
systemd 255 (v255-44.oe2403)
+PAM +AUDIT +SELINUX -APPARMOR +IMA -SMACK +SECCOMP +GCRYPT +GNUTLS -OPENSSL +ACL +BLKID -CURL -ELFUTILS -FIDO2 +IDN2 -IDN -IPTC +KMOD +LIBCRYPTSETUP +LIBFDISK +PCRE2 -PWQUALITY +P11KIT -QRENCODE -TPM2 +BZIP2 +LZ4 +XZ +ZLIB -ZSTD -BPF_FRAMEWORK +XKBCOMMON +UTMP +SYSVINIT
 default-hierarchy=legacy
</pre>
</div></div>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
于尚斌 通过JIRA 1001.0.0-SNAPSHOT#100287-rev:90748cbc67c5a251c09326b4553bc17f284abed0 生成于 Mon Jul 28 07:57:03 UTC 2025。

